[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0462","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0462.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0581","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 Telnet Server 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器的 Telnet 端口（默认 23）发送持续不断的二进制零字节流，导致 Telnet 服务进程崩溃，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Windows 2000 系统，攻击条件低，无需用户交互，但仅影响服务可用性，不涉及数据泄露或权限提升。Exploit-DB 已公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0581"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02Z","remediation":"安装微软 MS00-050 安全公告对应的补丁（KB Q267843），下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=24468975-8D52-485D-B018-4DA017799788。如无法立即打补丁，可在服务管理器中禁用 Telnet Server 服务（默认未启用）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1414","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000630161841.4619A-100000%40fjord.fscinternet.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20047","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0581.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0581","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0581.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0581.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gh92-r6m8-gq4c/GHSA-gh92-r6m8-gq4c.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0581.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1414/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0462.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0461","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0461.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0580","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 端口洪水拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 Server 存在端口洪泛拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的多个 TCP 和 UDP 端口持续发送大量二进制零数据包，导致系统 CPU 占用率急剧升高，正常服务响应缓慢甚至完全不可用。攻击无需身份认证，仅需网络可达即可发起，利用门槛低。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 Server 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。微软至今未发布官方补丁，建议通过防火墙限制异常流量缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0580"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02Z","remediation":"Windows 2000 已停止安全支持，建议升级至 Windows Server 2016 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在防火墙配置入站规则，限制 TCP/UDP 端口连接速率，并对非必要端口实施白名单策略，仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1415","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000630161935.4619B-100000%40fjord.fscinternet.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20048","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2000/CVE-2000-0580.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0580.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0580","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0580.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0580.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v3p7-33wf-f77j/GHSA-v3p7-33wf-f77j.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0580.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1415/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0461.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0451","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0451.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0569","title":"Sybergen Sygate DNS UDP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sybergen SyGate 2.0 及 3.11 版本在处理 DNS UDP 数据包时存在缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统的内部网络接口发送特制的畸形 DNS UDP 数据包，触发服务崩溃或停止响应，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞利用难度低，攻击者只需构造恶意 DNS 请求包即可实施攻击，影响 SyGate 网关产品的网络可用性。官方已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至最新版。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0569"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01Z","remediation":"Sybergen Sygate 2.0/3.11 已停止维护且厂商已不存在，无法通过官方补丁修复。建议立即迁移至仍在安全支持周期内的防火墙产品（如 Windows Defender 防火墙、第三方企业防火墙等），并在迁移完成前在网关/路由器层面过滤入站畸形 DNS UDP 数据包，阻止外部对内部接口的 DNS 协议访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q2/0189.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1420","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5049","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20051","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0569.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0569","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c144cc7f0a439e059cbec31e55f668a8db4215cb/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0569.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0569.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v2g6-64p5-pq6w/GHSA-v2g6-64p5-pq6w.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0569.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0569.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0451.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0737","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0737.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0612","title":"Microsoft Windows 9x/NT 4.0 ARP欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 操作系统在处理伪造的 ARP（地址解析协议）数据包时存在安全漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的伪造 ARP 响应包，从而覆盖目标系统 ARP 缓存表中的静态条目，导致网络通信流量被重定向至攻击者控制的设备，实现中间人攻击。该漏洞影响 Windows 95 和 Windows 98 系统，攻击者需与目标处于同一广播域内，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0612"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Windows 95/98/NT 4.0，微软不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到 Windows 10/11 等受支持版本；在无法升级的隔离网络中，可通过 `arp -s` 命令为关键网关和服务器添加静态 ARP 表项，并在交换机上启用端口安全（Port Security）和动态 ARP 检测（DAI）功能，防止伪造 ARP 包篡改缓存表。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1406","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=395B7E64.9FB3D4DB%40starzetz.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0612.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0612","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0612.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0612.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6h3c-53gf-6qc3/GHSA-6h3c-53gf-6qc3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0612.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1406/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0612.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0737.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0707","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0707.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0599","title":"iMesh 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"iMesh 1.02 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 iMesh 服务端口发送超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 iMesh 1.02 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。受影响用户应升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0599"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 iMesh 至 1.02 以上版本（官方下载页面 http://www.imesh.com/download/download.html），该版本已修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议在防火墙层面阻止外部对 iMesh 监听端口的访问，或彻底卸载 iMesh 改用其他安全的 P2P 文件共享软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0335.html","http://www.imesh.com/download/download.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1407","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0599.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0599","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0599.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0599.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fc9j-q76r-j649/GHSA-fc9j-q76r-j649.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0599.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0707.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0465","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0465.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0586","title":"DALnet Bahamut IRCd SUMMON 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"DALnet Bahamut IRCd 4.6.5 的 SUMMON 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 IRC 服务器发送特制的 SUMMON 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务或执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，影响运行 DALnet Bahamut IRCd 4.6.5 的所有系统。目前已存在公开的远程利用代码，攻击者可通过构造恶意数据包实现完全控制目标服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0586"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03Z","remediation":"升级到 Bahamut 1.8.x 或更高版本（Dalnet IRCd 后继版本已修复此漏洞）。如无法升级，重新编译 IRCd 时移除 ENABLE_SUMMON 编译选项以禁用 SUMMON 命令。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制对 IRC 端口（默认 6667）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q2/1092.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1404","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20043","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0586.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0586","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0586/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0586.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0586.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f54q-8494-3hvh/GHSA-f54q-8494-3hvh.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0586.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://gi