2.0 及 2.0.1 版本的 HTTP 代理服务组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送一个不包含 HTTP 版本号的畸形 GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致代理服务进程崩溃，停止响应正常请求。攻击者只需具备网络访问能力，无需任何权限或用户交互，即可反复利用该漏洞造成服务持续不可用。该漏洞影响 WinProxy 2.0 和 2.0.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0593"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04Z","remediation":"WinProxy 2.0 和 2.0.1 已停止维护，官方未发布补丁。建议立即卸载 WinProxy，迁移至仍受支持的代理服务器软件（如 Squid、HAProxy 等）。如无法立即替换，可在防火墙或网络边界配置规则，仅允许可信源 IP 访问代理服务的 HTTP 端口（默认 80/8080），以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1400","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006271417.GFE84146.-BJXON%40lac.co.jp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4831","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0593","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0593.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0593.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r33h-6mqf-5rp3/GHSA-r33h-6mqf-5rp3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0593.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1400/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--30006da0-3f15-476f-94c6-c793974a5d87.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0699.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0471","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0471.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0592","title":"SapporoWorks WinProxy POP3服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SapporoWorks WinProxy 2.0 及 2.0.1 版本的 POP3 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 POP3 服务发送超长的 USER、PASS、LIST、RETR 或 DELE 命令触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 WinProxy 邮件代理服务的机密性、完整性和可用性。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的远程利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0592"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04Z","remediation":"WinProxy 2.0 和 2.0.1 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即停止使用该版本，升级至受支持的替代代理服务器软件（如 Squid、HAProxy 等）。作为临时缓解措施，在防火墙层面限制对 POP3 端口（110/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的 POP3 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1400","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006271417.GFE84146.-BJXON%40lac.co.jp","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0592.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0592","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0592.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0592.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m5jq-cp4v-64qc/GHSA-m5jq-cp4v-64qc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0592.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1400/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0471.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0452","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0452.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0570","title":"Centrinity FirstClass Intranet Server 邮件长标头拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Centrinity FirstClass Intranet Server 6.1 之前版本（含 5.770）的邮件服务组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标服务器发送一封包含超长 To 邮件头部的特制邮件，即可触发该漏洞，导致邮件服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。攻击者可通过简单的网络连接完成利用，无需任何权限。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，已有公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0570"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01Z","remediation":"升级 FirstClass Internet Services 服务器至 6.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复对超长 To 邮件头处理不当导致的拒绝服务问题。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件服务方案，并在网络边界防火墙配置规则限制对 FirstClass 服务端口（默认 80/443）的不可信来源访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0295.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5718","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1421","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4843","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20052","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0570.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0570","https://github.com