形URL远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape Enterprise Server（运行于 NetWare 5.1 平台）存在输入验证漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的畸形 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致目标服务崩溃（拒绝服务）或在服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Netscape Enterprise Server 在 NetWare 5.1 上的部署版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0600"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 NetWare 5.1 至最新 Service Pack（SP8 及以上），并安装 Netscape Enterprise Server 3.6 SP3 或更新版本。在无法升级的情况下，在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF，过滤包含畸形 URL 的请求，特别是含有异常编码、超长路径或特殊字符的 HTTP 请求。鉴于该产品已停止技术支持，建议迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器平台（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0264.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1393","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4780","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0600.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0600","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0600.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0600.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fpcj-q3j2-7545/GHSA-fpcj-q3j2-7545.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0600.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/ob